 "remarks": "Welcome to an unbeatable opportunity in Norwalk! This well-maintained 2-bed, 1-bath co-op offers smart living at an extraordinary price. Step inside to an open, light-filled layout that flows easily from room to room. The heart of the home is the spacious living area, perfect for everyday living or entertaining guests.  Downstairs you'll find a finished rec room - a flexible space ideal for a home office, playroom, media lounge, or gym. Practical comforts abound, including convenient off-street parking, making city living that much easier.  With affordability, functional space, and smart upgrades, this co-op delivers lifestyle and value. Don't miss your chance - properties at this price rarely last!",
